"/windows": "<p> We operate across Poland — Lower Silesia, Opole, Greater Poland and Lubusz voivodeships</p> <section> <h1>Window Cleaning</h1><p>Professional window cleaning for home and office. Clean windows — more light and comfort!</p> </section><section><h2>Window Cleaning Calculator</h2><p> Order <p>Single-sash window</p><p>40 zł</p> </p> <p> Order <p>Double-sash window</p><p>50 zł</p> </p> <p> Order <p>Triple-sash window</p><p>80 zł</p> </p> <p> Order <p>Balcony window</p><p>60 zł</p> </p> <p> Order <p>Terrace window</p><p>85 zł</p> </p> <p> Order <p>Attic window</p><p>40 zł</p> </p> <p> Order <p>Balustrade</p><p>40 zł</p> </p> <p> Order <p>Glass panel cleaning (balustrades, glass partitions)</p><p>10 zł/m²</p> </p> </section><section><h2>Request a Quote</h2> </section><section><h2>Window cleaning gallery</h2> </section><section> <h2>Why clean windows?</h2><p>Clean windows let in more light, create a pleasant atmosphere and extend the life of your windows. Professional cleaning removes ingrained dirt, dust and streaks that are difficult to remove on your own.</p> <h3>Benefits of clean windows</h3><ul><li> More natural light at home </li><li> Clean and well-maintained appearance </li><li> Extended window lifespan </li><li> Comfortable atmosphere indoors </li></ul> </section><section><h2>How we work</h2>1 <h3>Assessment</h3><p>We inspect the windows and determine the scope of work</p> 2 <h3>Cleaning</h3><p>We use professional products and tools</p> 3 <h3>Result</h3><p>Perfectly clean windows without streaks</p> </section><section><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>How much does window cleaning cost? </h3>Single-sash window 40 PLN, double-sash 50 PLN, triple-sash 80 PLN. The price includes glass, frame and sill. <h3>Are frames and sills included in the price? </h3>Yes, each window price covers glass on both sides, the frame and the sill. <h3>Do you clean windows at height? </h3>Yes, we clean windows at height using telescopic pole systems with demineralised water. <h3>Will there be streaks after cleaning? </h3>No — we use demineralised water and professional squeegees, so the glass dries streak-free. <h3>Do you clean windows in winter? </h3>Yes, we work all year round. Below freezing we use frost-resistant solutions. </section>"
